# Build output. `npm run lint` is `eslint .`, which without this walks dist/ —
# hundreds of generated chunks including a ~700KB single-line bundle. Linting
# minified output is both meaningless (it is generated, not authored) and
# pathologically slow: the run went from minutes-with-no-end to seconds.
dist/

# Service worker shipped as-is from public/, not authored against these rules.
public/sw.js

# Capacitor native projects. Same failure as dist/ above, and for the same
# reason: `cap sync` copies the whole built bundle into each platform
# (android/app/src/main/assets/public, ios/App/App/public), so the minified
# chunk that made `eslint .` hang is now in the tree three times over. The rest
# is Gradle and Xcode scaffolding generated by `cap add` — not authored here.
android/
ios/
